  era: "Section 24 \xB7 Rise of Nationalism \xB7 1850s \u2013 1910s"
  title: Extremists
  text: Bal Gangadhar Tilak, Lala Lajpat Rai and Bipin Chandra Pal, known as Lal, Bal and Pal, demanded swaraj through mass action. Tilak declared that swaraj is my birthright and I shall have it. The Congress split at Surat in 1907.
